 creating depth and dimension without excess. Our signature A-stitch traces the shoe\u2019s lines with intention, and a new side logo marks it as unmistakably APL. A padded collar adds comfort where it matters most. Special detailing includes a light pink satin lining and satin side logo. \\nHere\u2019s the part you can\u2019t see. Beneath the refined upper sits the same performance midsole engineering that you love, tuned for maximum cushioning in a minimal stack height. It\u2019s why a shoe this elegant feels like a gift on your foot. Comfort here isn\u2019t an afterthought, it\u2019s our heritage, hidden inside something beautiful.\\nThis is luxury performance, the way only APL makes it. Designed by artists, crafted by engineers.\\nAn extra set of laces is included for versatile wear and styling options. 10mm drop. Women's size 7.5 is 9 oz.\\n The APL Riviera is crafted with premium materials that are not waterproof or colorfast. Avoid rain and excessive moisture to help preserve their original appearance.\\nIn support of Breast Cancer Awareness, from October 1, 2026 through September 30, 2027, APL is donating 20% of the sales price of the APL Women\u2019s Riviera Ivory /Flamingo BCA to the Women\u2019s Cancer Research Fund, A Breast Cancer Research Foundation Program (BCRF), with a minimum guaranteed donation of $5,000 for the limited-edition release. WCRF supports the advancement of the world\u2019s most promising research directed at the development of innovative approaches to the prevention, diagnosis, treatment, survivorship and metastasis of breast cancer. Visit www.wcrfcure.org for more information. This shoe is a limited-edition release.\",\"variant_title\":\"IVORY / FLAMINGO / 5\",\"variant_options\":[\"IVORY / FLAMINGO\",\"5\"],\"options_with_values\":[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"value\":\"IVORY / FLAMINGO\"},{\"name\":\"Size\",\"value\":\"5\"}],\"line_level_discount_allocations\":[],\"line_level_total_discount\":0,\"quantity_rule\":{\"min\":1,\"max\":null,\"